{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/475526-deceived-101","id":475526,"title":"Deceived 101","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-10T01:21:01-07:00","id":475526,"title":"Deceived 101","content":"I'm not a Mummy player but I like to have at least a cursory knowledge of all the major splats and antagonists n the various WOD games. The Deceived are the only ones I can't find any information on. This is probably due to the idea of ST-specific information that runs through Mummy. Which is cool, given the game's theme of memory, but ,as someone who doesn't play Mummy, I'd just like to know out of personal curiosity. Could someoone give me a basic thumbnail sketch of their ideology?<br /> <br /> Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2336-alokov","name":"alokov","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T01:37:07-07:00","id":475549,"title":"","content":"The average Arisen know the Deceived as the Lost Guild or Sixth Guild, wiped from memory for some sin too terrible to remember. Most view them as a vague cautionary tale about hubris or an Arisen urban legend.<br /> <br /> Spoilers ahead.<br /> <br /> The Akhem-Urtu were the Sixth Guild of Irem, artists and philosophers and astronomers who had an unparalleled grasp of the Nomenclature that governs the universe. When it came time to perform the Rite of Return and ascend to the thrones of the Judges, the seven Shan'iatu of the Akhem-Urtu were betrayed by their peers, instead being shattered into immaterial entities known as temakh. The temakh of the Lost Guild ride their mummy servants, spurring them to madness, artistic inspiration, and burning hatred of the Arisen who serve their treacherous peers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T03:31:49-07:00","id":475589,"title":"","content":"Well, they were all temakhs and eventually, as they began to settle into a mortal-like lifestyle, they took on the title of Shan'iatu.<br /> <br /> But yeah","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T12:25:06-07:00","id":476198,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/475526-deceived-101?p=475589#post475589\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, they were all temakhs and eventually, as they began to settle into a mortal-like lifestyle, they took on the title of Shan'iatu.<br /> <br /> But yeah</div> </div> </div> </div>No, Shan'iatu was a title given by the Judges to the children of the temakh.<br /> <br /> But whatever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}